Package: spacescans
Type: Package
Title: Link Time-Referenced Geolocation Data to the Spatial and Contextual Exposome
Version: 0.3.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Xuguang", "Ai", email = "xuguang.ai@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Regenstrief Institute", role = "aut"))
Description: R client for the 'spacescans' 'Python' pipeline, which links
    time-referenced geolocation data (location episodes of study
    participants) to the spatial and contextual exposome and returns one row
    per participant or per location episode. The pipeline runs in a separate
    'Python' process that the package talks to through JSON request and result
    files and 'Parquet' tables, so a crash or an interrupt in 'Python' never
    takes the R session down. 'ss_install()' builds the 'Python' environment
    with 'uv'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/IU-Ultraman/spacescans
BugReports: https://github.com/IU-Ultraman/spacescans/issues
