VignetteBuilder: knitr
SystemRequirements: Python 3.12 with the 'spacescans' Python package,
    installed by ss_install() with 'uv' (<https://docs.astral.sh/uv/>);
    macOS 14 or later on Apple silicon is the supported platform.
